BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (insurance, and only the no-insurance press triggers the RTB hunt across the buyers under that routing plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm ([tf4AieS7Mhc @ 00:00:30]. Ringba's own walkthrough of the three core flows frames the audible IVR the same way,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (using a debt example where callers with more than ten thousand dollars in unsecured credit card debt press one and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (everyone else presses two and falls out [4dnXkZ7u6zw @ 00:00:51]. Shane Hitchcock at Ringba argues the opposite) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (side of the wire: IVRs can be conversion killers for any call campaign, so Ringba's Dial IVR uses software and DTMF) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (tones to bypass a buyer's unnecessary menus without the customer ever hearing it, timing how long the prompt takes) Tj ET
