BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (contact centers refuse a traditional audible IVR entirely yet still run its silent functions, connecting to back-end systems) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (and identifying the caller from the displayed telephone number [8f7qA0z-AgQ @ 00:01:31]. The operator choice is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (screening friction on your side versus raw speed into the buyer's live agent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (A second fork is where qualification data gets captured in the first place. Landerlab skips the keypad and qualifies on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (the landing page: a quiz asks the current insurance carrier and homeowner status, injects the Ringba number pool script,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (pushes the carrier value into a URL parameter, and a router node with filters sends Allstate and Geico callers to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (separate routing plans [DMS29IlU8pE @ 00:12:18]. Ringba's warm transfer model puts a human in that seat instead,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (where a qualifying call center agent asks a list of questions before handing off, and the conversion event typically lands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (on the transfer [4dnXkZ7u6zw @ 00:01:24]. Henryk Brzozowski routes before any agent speaks, using a Retell AI) Tj ET
