BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 366.55 Tm (something that is not the correct answer, so a press one for coverage triggers a second, longer menu that opens with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.32 Tm (please listen carefully as our menu has changed and splits Medicaid, Medicare and no government benefits into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.10 Tm (separate keys before a call is written off [tf4AieS7Mhc @ 00:02:13]. Corona also found callers tune out a single voice,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.87 Tm (and swapping voices across prompts keeps them alert, a finding credited to plain testing [tf4AieS7Mhc @ 00:07:06].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 305.65 Tm (Spam is the other leak: Ringba's robocall verification template plays a text-to-speech press one to continue, and any) Tj ET
