BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.97 Tm (increments an attempt counter, plays an audio file confirming something went awry, loops back to the gather, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.75 Tm (disconnects after two failed attempts [VByuomL6T0s @ 00:04:54]. Without that loop, confused callers either get) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.52 Tm (dumped or route blind, and both outcomes burn paid traffic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.30 Tm (Build errors stall launches more often than strategy does. Ringba's IVR builder refuses to save a tree that lacks a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.07 Tm (hang-up node for calls that fail to connect to the routing plan, marking the error in red on the node [Vd_ZoE2BRqQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.85 Tm (00:02:22]. WildJar's James hit the same wall live: the save failed with red lines around both transfers because no target) Tj ET
