BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.40 Tm (errors until each router branch had a routing plan selected, and the team verified the number pool script by checking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.17 Tm (that the base number on the page was replaced by a Ringba pool number before running a live mobile test and reading) Tj ET
