BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (speed whenever payouts or eligibility diverge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Duplicate callers split operators into two camps. The aggressive camp resells every repeat: Adam reports duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (rates of at least 5% on the low end and up to 25% on the high end across hundreds of verticals, while networks refuse) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (to pay for a duplicate roughly 98% of the time or more, so monetizing any slice of that band is pure profit) Tj ET
