BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.10 Tm (call-only ads disappearing and policy shifts every two to three years. Its answer is AI-assisted landing pages and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.87 Tm (suspension appeals [wybWVvxFiI0 @ 00:01:14]. Marketcall flags two self-inflicted triggers on Meta. Uploading) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.65 Tm (bought lists as custom audiences can get the account suspended. Coronavirus-angle health ads are risky enough that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.42 Tm (some advertisers resort to cloaking [9msaK2zlGMI @ 00:24:34]. Network access is its own gate. Vanel Sylvestre says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.20 Tm (networks detect applicants from Pakistan, Bangladesh, India, and Haiti, which is why he routes through a $2 PureVPN.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.97 Tm (His pages also geo-localize visitors and block non-US traffic with a 'Service available in the United States only' notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.75 Tm ([B2slPImGPD8 @ 00:15:10]. John Ventura puts compliance first for the same reason, pointing to FTC and state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.52 Tm (crackdowns and TCPA fines of $500-1,500 per violation. Across these operators, the ad account, payment profile, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.30 Tm (network approval all sit upstream of every call-economics spreadsheet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.07 Tm (The second trap is paying for calls that never bill. ExclusiveLiveCall runs the math: $1,000 buys 50 calls, but only 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.85 Tm (are billable at $60. That $1,800 in revenue leaves $800 before other expenses, which is why 'quality and economics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.62 Tm (have to be measured together' [grygjesM2j8 @ 00:01:48]. Marketcall's Facebook health benchmarks put billable rates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.40 Tm (at 40-70%, turning $8-15 raw calls into $20-25 billable calls at 20-50% ROI, and callers must be able to afford $150 a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.17 Tm (month. Ryan Moran prices the leak up front. Assume 50% click-to-call and one in three calls chargeable, so a sale costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.95 Tm (roughly six clicks, or CPC times six [yB7cDGVlP0k @ 00:05:59]. Downey Marketing traces clicks without calls to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 91.72 Tm (Performance Max and Smart spam, broad keywords, lumped ad groups, and homepage traffic. The fix is Search Terms) Tj ET
