BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 561.65 Tm ([-GEw-hz8tiY @ 00:22:43]. ceohec has been stiffed by buyers who never closed and therefore felt no incentive to pay,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 546.42 Tm (hence the upfront payment rule, the $500 to $1,000 minimum deposit advice, and publishers on net 10 whenever the) Tj ET
