BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 485.52 Tm (the only scoreboard that pays rent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 470.30 Tm (Fraud shows up as patterns, and the Ringba masterclass maps the ugliest one: callback fraud, where the agent says let) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.07 Tm (me call you back and the conversion escapes tracking entirely. The real example was a braces caller on a 40-second call) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.85 Tm (with about 35 seconds of talk time against a 1:30 conversion threshold, and smaller buyers running 10 to 30 agents are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 424.62 Tm (likelier to pull it [JxU9bgFTUUs @ 00:14:42]. Detection is mechanical: filter non-converted calls, sort by duration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 409.40 Tm (highest to lowest under the threshold, group by buyer, ignore 5-to-8-second calls, then hand the network the recording) Tj ET
